  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是头一次在青岛过夏。",
      "output_sha256": "0edc268afaefb3945d9121460e9c849287720eb10d6a2ab6888076ed54fe98e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "0edc268afaefb3945d9121460e9c849287720eb10d6a2ab6888076ed54fe98e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一点不吹，咱算是开了眼。",
      "output_sha256": "f888cafb2c7bd73f728e0ecd211ab1b9be83494251d366976819e9f647ad0418",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "f888cafb2c7bd73f728e0ecd211ab1b9be83494251d366976819e9f647ad0418",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，只能说开眼；没有别的好处。",
      "output_sha256": "84d5f1c1e054d1ceeb801b1689cfe47a55d9de7e0b7e2213a922c8c5762dda41",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "84d5f1c1e054d1ceeb801b1689cfe47a55d9de7e0b7e2213a922c8c5762dda41",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "就拿海水浴来说吧，我在海边见到了那么多的人，确实让人眼前一亮！",
      "output_sha256": "157317d200064df973f7e9feceaa2eec772293222ba906eff94e142074d2594d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.429541,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4798a6596243d8756b0e0f74eef988974451cd916326efbc3aeb92a99bc4f13a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "157317d200064df973f7e9feceaa2eec772293222ba906eff94e142074d2594d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是咱自家不敢露一手儿。",
      "output_sha256": "476a9e1fbbd03b47ce25ca8054c0482f40c0a8b6d748a485cfa8502d8c690e52",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "476a9e1fbbd03b47ce25ca8054c0482f40c0a8b6d748a485cfa8502d8c690e52",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "您可以想象，一个比蛇还瘦的人，穿着那种不伦不类的浴衣，脖子上套着游泳圈，站在海滩上，身上骨骼分明，这不就是故意让人发笑吗？",
      "output_sha256": "48b5dbb8a865baa8af005f949cde4410a96be14ac6daa8794cb962db61415978",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.524816,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f674d550317657ec34adb55544a8c18f20c784a2597f885ef94387d6b53d4b99"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "48b5dbb8a865baa8af005f949cde4410a96be14ac6daa8794cb962db61415978",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "即使别人不觉得奇怪，我也不敢跳下水；脖子上挂着游泳圈，只能在沙滩上“憧憬”一番，虽然泄气没关系，但也不能泄得太离谱。",
      "output_sha256": "eab61035c76aecd3ed9a43b96ad8cb40eda0ffe02a496e637b5018dcf3427bc9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.487412,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "02db042b391f5edd6d333df2e4553605a9d57cc4973d7d27574b7a47ef06757f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eab61035c76aecd3ed9a43b96ad8cb40eda0ffe02a496e637b5018dcf3427bc9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "咱只能穿着夏布大衫，远远的瞧着；偶尔遇上个异教卫道的人，相对微笑点首，叹风化之不良；其实他也跟我一样，不敢下水。",
      "output_sha256": "ce27232c5a782582d9e857f500571ac7c8f244afcf9082c9dab8920b0527f4bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "ce27232c5a782582d9e857f500571ac7c8f244afcf9082c9dab8920b0527f4bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "海水浴没了咱的事。",
      "output_sha256": "1e70c09cd3aebfb90708996816f85dc5066ace340950ce4ec057f77f5feb922f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "1e70c09cd3aebfb90708996816f85dc5066ace340950ce4ec057f77f5feb922f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "白天在海岸，晚上自然要去舞场。",
      "output_sha256": "e855edf1f803698a1c3ef85dec6e9d391e905f7f33f95c000c6d027ad11a85bd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.609762,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cd6c1748ad5ee19b738607eebcb23e47750809715d3a0918f06d1eda1bba7594"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e855edf1f803698a1c3ef85dec6e9d391e905f7f33f95c000c6d027ad11a85bd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "青岛到夏天，的确是热闹：白舞女，黄舞女，黑舞女，都光着脚，脚指甲上涂得通红晶亮，鞋只是两根绊儿和两个高底。",
      "output_sha256": "1a9e0736d3e51e3d638bde0d5eb7415fbf37ba2783a88fdb16d3cae1deaf672a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "1a9e0736d3e51e3d638bde0d5eb7415fbf37ba2783a88fdb16d3cae1deaf672a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "衣服，帽子，花样之多简直说不尽。",
      "output_sha256": "8634638172c310915c9d7143be578efdaa25b7782af4857195f8ce61c861ecaf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "8634638172c310915c9d7143be578efdaa25b7782af4857195f8ce61c861ecaf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "按理说我既不敢下海，晚上应该去舞场跳舞，出出汗，活动活动。",
      "output_sha256": "054f22d6da7c7fac8dd79b8990d7deb496f807b5bcd64191d31cf4d50a908751",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.634735,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5add38370b46a6613f43b63d676bf0212a9341e79aa2f935237390cad29ebb0f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "054f22d6da7c7fac8dd79b8990d7deb496f807b5bcd64191d31cf4d50a908751",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "咱又没这个造化。",
      "output_sha256": "732929c3912d3e26fc39b691521503ea68013dc15ad4c954a1ab4063f3b8abfd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "732929c3912d3e26fc39b691521503ea68013dc15ad4c954a1ab4063f3b8abfd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第一，晚上一过九点就想睡；到舞场买票睡觉，似乎大可不必。",
      "output_sha256": "6db4b94ff752d366a23879801add8d3dba9ec1c7e2283b60391404978fb383d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "6db4b94ff752d366a23879801add8d3dba9ec1c7e2283b60391404978fb383d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其次，跳舞倒是可以凑合着跳，但人家不踩我的脚，而我却踩了人家的，虽然这也算有点独特，但总是让人难以开口。",
      "output_sha256": "2f2fc3c25afb76f1ac86fd76184c57bdf900f70ef6e26d84d82812b74fe4d4a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.471369,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4785745a77bf6c14566a8122b9919527a778c4150d3ce21b88ebd719ac1f6eeb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2f2fc3c25afb76f1ac86fd76184c57bdf900f70ef6e26d84d82812b74fe4d4a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "莫若早早的睡吧，不招灾，不惹祸。",
      "output_sha256": "5ab6477e7c85e9666c95138b3144a6753cd8151e958784aec5a289cd68305a45",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "5ab6477e7c85e9666c95138b3144a6753cd8151e958784aec5a289cd68305a45",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "况且这么规规矩矩，也足引起太太的敬意，她甚至想登报颂扬我的“仁政”，可是被我拦住了，我向来是不好虚荣的。",
      "output_sha256": "0680a182c6b3801510dc5a6c80f4d15d76058b4a23e39c58f8de54ccc75efc91",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "0680a182c6b3801510dc5a6c80f4d15d76058b4a23e39c58f8de54ccc75efc91",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "既然不去热闹场所，那就想在家里找些乐趣。",
      "output_sha256": "0ee1bcf8357a0e69fcef3161f2e33670ee36666d86f20044b640df3cf81b38d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.606538,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8cb0dd3569063323e51a0a64571a4fc0222260c58cc2f503083d92713cfb38d7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0ee1bcf8357a0e69fcef3161f2e33670ee36666d86f20044b640df3cf81b38d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18,
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "唱戏、打牌、听无线电广播等都是青岛时下流行的活动。",
      "output_sha256": "0ebf060aab248f7be85ab574c41f60dc376c737749e1f52570033b491c5b2dbb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.606538,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8cb0dd3569063323e51a0a64571a4fc0222260c58cc2f503083d92713cfb38d7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0ebf060aab248f7be85ab574c41f60dc376c737749e1f52570033b491c5b2dbb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18,
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "以唱戏说，不但早晨在家中吊嗓子的很多，此地还有许多剧社，锣鼓俱全，角色齐备，倒怪有个意思。",
      "output_sha256": "732405fc838af868bc07f3bd00ead63e5cb90ea299420c5cbee984d834c9ca59",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "732405fc838af868bc07f3bd00ead63e5cb90ea299420c5cbee984d834c9ca59",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我想加入剧社，小时候还听过谭鑫培的戏，当然有资格。",
      "output_sha256": "ca8a5b3e48c5e655c3e2f9eb3e6a12e4c987e252e0f9073eea8b643128f3ec84",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.681731,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "10689b1620721f2c3be5da1161d0a977336695c410b3520a1aa5ee66d6e72409"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ca8a5b3e48c5e655c3e2f9eb3e6a12e4c987e252e0f9073eea8b643128f3ec84",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "找了介绍人，交了会费，头一天我就露了一出《武家坡》。",
      "output_sha256": "0d64e1e6492fcb1764ce19b8e15a96508f1bdacd7b2ae1f302f97357fceb642b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d64e1e6492fcb1764ce19b8e15a96508f1bdacd7b2ae1f302f97357fceb642b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我觉得唱得不错，第二天早早就去了，再想露一出拿手的。",
      "output_sha256": "afc6b5749f214a5de08988cc8f2c0851c5505f64c1c4c7e193bed229c8e67ef0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "afc6b5749f214a5de08988cc8f2c0851c5505f64c1c4c7e193bed229c8e67ef0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "等了足有两点钟吧。",
      "output_sha256": "44e05965438a5fcda68f6cbae9becd7aebc2bcb5302dfea1f14b320815d4121c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "44e05965438a5fcda68f6cbae9becd7aebc2bcb5302dfea1f14b320815d4121c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一个人也没来，社员们太不热心呀，我想。",
      "output_sha256": "d9e84aa75fc7ba0d26ba16626d9454cda6d423bab7bb8b9fd80d1b234c6cd3e6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "d9e84aa75fc7ba0d26ba16626d9454cda6d423bab7bb8b9fd80d1b234c6cd3e6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第三天我又去了，还是没人，这未免有点奇怪。",
      "output_sha256": "25781cce7e415def501f47356dc0845bdeaf58bb91ca6fdda1dc3aa09f9f79bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "25781cce7e415def501f47356dc0845bdeaf58bb91ca6fdda1dc3aa09f9f79bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "坐了十几分钟我就出来了，门口遇见一个小孩。",
      "output_sha256": "3402a8608fbfad45c186cef1c615995005fd7bfaa635cd2fec73e1b59c2cab3e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.711154,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "35550d110ce9866c416df34f56a209002aa4b80efb5435bbbd91f930f4da7845"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3402a8608fbfad45c186cef1c615995005fd7bfaa635cd2fec73e1b59c2cab3e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“小朋友，”我和气地问，“这里怎么总没人？”",
      "output_sha256": "e9c831f3af195a61f38497afcd1334a14090be0aa2c0c6be198c55f7ea1df6c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.488077,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0ff697ef4ad3ffb20d3e96fc5f5803bac92755abf275fe69013a0094ff166611"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e9c831f3af195a61f38497afcd1334a14090be0aa2c0c6be198c55f7ea1df6c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "小孩原来是看守票房李六的儿子，知道不少事儿。",
      "output_sha256": "762663814aed7d97319a6d8cf977234f39500763808fd143d5d64291a64ec7a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "762663814aed7d97319a6d8cf977234f39500763808fd143d5d64291a64ec7a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“这几天没人来，因为呀，”小孩笑着看了我一眼，“前天有位先生唱得像鸭子叫，所以大家都不来了；前天您来了吗？”",
      "output_sha256": "18202653f705cb4ba5327297f7d06cdacd92010c39c112eedaeae5d96954b1ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.806689,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fce426f62f72eef6878107107285010e61ba8de50cecc89b60b6587876dc85d8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "18202653f705cb4ba5327297f7d06cdacd92010c39c112eedaeae5d96954b1ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我摇了摇头，一声没出就回了家。",
      "output_sha256": "9c55e04e451d591ba8c176501964975501fb0cd4b45d9e7ea90e57112b3c64a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "9c55e04e451d591ba8c176501964975501fb0cd4b45d9e7ea90e57112b3c64a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "回到家，我心里有些不舒服。",
      "output_sha256": "dda4c8be7add6e41af45f77adea947f278b84419dcca93908f6d61ea8b149958",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.401873,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "edfba4c3c51b17c75baf515f8de857867bee3854b7099c64892b590ad07715aa"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dda4c8be7add6e41af45f77adea947f278b84419dcca93908f6d61ea8b149958",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是继而一想呢，票友们多半是有习气的，也许我唱得本来很好，而他们“欺生”。",
      "output_sha256": "6d08de98b61fb3d6ae2fa8d71e48645e86bc8aa805acac6221f0f3da097ab88e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "6d08de98b61fb3d6ae2fa8d71e48645e86bc8aa805acac6221f0f3da097ab88e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这么一想，我就决定在家里独唱，不必再出去怄闲气。",
      "output_sha256": "688dc05555acbc284c28931588c54739f3ad0279768237e86eace99bd4a4666c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "688dc05555acbc284c28931588c54739f3ad0279768237e86eace99bd4a4666c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "唱，我一个人可就唱开了，“文武代打”，好不过瘾！",
      "output_sha256": "9001ed3df19df606b3fa528a3845cc3c0fc9f2d993cc7b57fa06597958fd6bb0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "9001ed3df19df606b3fa528a3845cc3c0fc9f2d993cc7b57fa06597958fd6bb0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "唱到第三天，房东来了，客气地请我搬走。",
      "output_sha256": "26d1afc3083bfab11beb4834235a760c6bf2afcd5d7f3a794c71f305bea30e4c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.672615,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "66ab1ac9c369f1b64ae94d3fffaf0b2dfe71817568230eb09c0512eeec958459"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "26d1afc3083bfab11beb4834235a760c6bf2afcd5d7f3a794c71f305bea30e4c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36,
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "房东临走时，低声对太太说：“如果先生不唱，那就不必搬了，大家都是朋友！”",
      "output_sha256": "d390e0959772490f3276fe65c199a81938d02505db91b2729312a5913f7da823",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.672615,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "66ab1ac9c369f1b64ae94d3fffaf0b2dfe71817568230eb09c0512eeec958459"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d390e0959772490f3276fe65c199a81938d02505db91b2729312a5913f7da823",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36,
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "太太自然怕搬家，先生自然怕太太，我首先声明我很讨厌唱戏。",
      "output_sha256": "916ce0b57e6b16c3b765bd2d7e6ce501cf75c5c6aed07ac15ee4e32e8f538c2f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "916ce0b57e6b16c3b765bd2d7e6ce501cf75c5c6aed07ac15ee4e32e8f538c2f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我正要去买个收音机，邻居郑家已经买好了，我心里不太舒服。",
      "output_sha256": "89d80ce97580001dc4308583c860d65a867eafe880122dd14057606b87c5318c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.592333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7c1d0ba7d69d9a4452ed4916d68ab2362445e63aa5ce976b3aaf7c348952c3f5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "89d80ce97580001dc4308583c860d65a867eafe880122dd14057606b87c5318c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在青岛，什么事走迟了一步，风头就被别人出尽；我不必再花钱了，既然已叫郑家抢了先。",
      "output_sha256": "d309799de9d8f888ec2a5b23a7ac4e70ce0de9a82bd5c052d569fcd51b913202",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "d309799de9d8f888ec2a5b23a7ac4e70ce0de9a82bd5c052d569fcd51b913202",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "再说呢，他们播放，我听得很真，何必一定打对仗呢。",
      "output_sha256": "ab712f39c2e5102c51ce2d487b25e3601802e0d5fbbc273069e197414c9cced4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "ab712f39c2e5102c51ce2d487b25e3601802e0d5fbbc273069e197414c9cced4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我决定等着听便宜的。",
      "output_sha256": "1f2145362ecfa5019094c8db468e37b82214f0d0e921fe52d29bb237951a6069",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f2145362ecfa5019094c8db468e37b82214f0d0e921fe52d29bb237951a6069",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "郑家的机器真不坏，据说花了八百多块。",
      "output_sha256": "e5483ebcd4310bece496996ba533bf7a6ca4a2e2c06675127ee3fde89c0e6f8e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "e5483ebcd4310bece496996ba533bf7a6ca4a2e2c06675127ee3fde89c0e6f8e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "每到早十点，他们必转弄那个玩艺。",
      "output_sha256": "4a479e1db9e526f1cf058cf12e15a36e6b6f2fa478ac45e3456a419dd7bba1f4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a479e1db9e526f1cf058cf12e15a36e6b6f2fa478ac45e3456a419dd7bba1f4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "起初像火车的挂钩，嘎！",
      "output_sha256": "552ae76d2fb6380d34de40bc46bb34a804713ceec42c69a547928888319e34ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.675,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0577d719349cdddecc81f2f196a23f8f357694c5561c22db2cb07fe752dc071a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "552ae76d2fb6380d34de40bc46bb34a804713ceec42c69a547928888319e34ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "哗啦，哗啦！",
      "output_sha256": "69e3010df4ba32bca146caf1d565f941ade73ce7cd3d5dcc1ce4a22610f415e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "69e3010df4ba32bca146caf1d565f941ade73ce7cd3d5dcc1ce4a22610f415e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "哗啦了半天，好似怕人讨厌它太单调，忽然改了腔儿，细声细气的，像老牛害病时那样呻吟。",
      "output_sha256": "6cfcedb46fc3ca965fc06d571ad9c47e92abac9fa6b1ac630f0ea0fdeb5f4b5a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "6cfcedb46fc3ca965fc06d571ad9c47e92abac9fa6b1ac630f0ea0fdeb5f4b5a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "猛古丁的又改了办法，啪啪，喔——喔，越来越尖，咯喳！",
      "output_sha256": "f0ab2e62cfd08b348b37e3f5c00be574ac39b376aa2e97132517fe0822f92017",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "f0ab2e62cfd08b348b37e3f5c00be574ac39b376aa2e97132517fe0822f92017",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我还以为院子里的柳树被风刮断了！",
      "output_sha256": "c488abf9a2a2aa45e632dd761ac6d0e5c583c985cf306b64a02e4c4c793ac778",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.610116,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "36ab7932c4f2588f26a454f3f11321892cb441bf0d00e7a080e1c7a66b31c2b8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c488abf9a2a2aa45e632dd761ac6d0e5c583c985cf306b64a02e4c4c793ac778",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是前奏曲。",
      "output_sha256": "f9d02ef83bf5ff465f9bb6c0807f7c40c3dfc0399076fc0b22ff4bcd72f53e0c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "f9d02ef83bf5ff465f9bb6c0807f7c40c3dfc0399076fc0b22ff4bcd72f53e0c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一切静寂，有五分钟的样子，忽然兜着我的耳根子：“南京！”",
      "output_sha256": "95018aa2b88d9608b3f4a3e7029c9252f3281cd7d4fbce761508fcc839dc0fce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "95018aa2b88d9608b3f4a3e7029c9252f3281cd7d4fbce761508fcc839dc0fce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "也就是我呀，修养差一点的，管保得惊疯！",
      "output_sha256": "f90a13e1b1dce0476387205d360bb1e6afeae5d49e865257f4200d62b1095264",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "f90a13e1b1dce0476387205d360bb1e6afeae5d49e865257f4200d62b1095264",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "吃了一颗定心丸，我还是想听听南京的情况。",
      "output_sha256": "c4f5c4abe5c5053e565bbb0091086a3eb1b236f64cb1254fd2c2aec8d9820cbc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.519786,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0798e3b004858f211bf1f323f0be745ec62a0bf10b34a3cd16f53eabfa4a757a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c4f5c4abe5c5053e565bbb0091086a3eb1b236f64cb1254fd2c2aec8d9820cbc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "呕，结果原来南京的底下是——“王小姐唱《毛毛雨》”。",
      "output_sha256": "42674b8a82c2f1170fbae9114e9ff60a7928a36680f138f46c605e2018663863",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.859641,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "307222810ebadecdea67b48cf44460ee323ea6066d755bd3bddb241feb4be5b6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "42674b8a82c2f1170fbae9114e9ff60a7928a36680f138f46c605e2018663863",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这首《毛毛雨》可与众不同：第一声很足，第二声突然像被风刮走，第三声又变成火车挂钩的声音，紧接着刮风、下雨、打雷，空军袭击城市，海啸；《毛毛雨》根本听不见了。",
      "output_sha256": "f63e209b857a54f14f3eba36f3b171870f5b35477212589bfe966b9b88715760",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.741691,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "44356a191b018d9f93e1c9783352b63669ceee4eb76d385e4853edab906d30b9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f63e209b857a54f14f3eba36f3b171870f5b35477212589bfe966b9b88715760",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "闹了一大阵，兜着我的耳根子——“北平！”",
      "output_sha256": "1cda26cabda8850ac2cae67768afc79ec4a0e2cb4fe8d58451b4490234a91287",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "1cda26cabda8850ac2cae67768afc79ec4a0e2cb4fe8d58451b4490234a91287",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我赶紧堵上耳朵。",
      "output_sha256": "5755ede42fe95a651a76b5465866d83dc5bc3162355b9d8d90f357198eb9e030",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.609249,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6f093f7635ab98e3b9c258b11fe87418d41c5bb7c987041e9892bc99af1ebfb3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5755ede42fe95a651a76b5465866d83dc5bc3162355b9d8d90f357198eb9e030",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "早晨如是，下午如是，夜间如是；这回该我找房东去了。",
      "output_sha256": "f21f337b69451ccd63a7440d2aaf8214948c406be22dc033c0a09460eb536e08",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "f21f337b69451ccd63a7440d2aaf8214948c406be22dc033c0a09460eb536e08",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我搬了家。",
      "output_sha256": "28e0d4f01a20052af81404c6b968281c391de12f9d49c8ad9b99df87394992bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "28e0d4f01a20052af81404c6b968281c391de12f9d49c8ad9b99df87394992bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "还有就是打小牌，或许可以不招惹麻烦，但我始终没有耐心。",
      "output_sha256": "053faf30f5e61bafaf29af56678c474e8dc6cd2a3612accaeb1185ef77def681",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": 0.540015,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        59
