      "source_ai_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_ai_sha256": "053faf30f5e61bafaf29af56678c474e8dc6cd2a3612accaeb1185ef77def681",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "叫我打一圈吗，还可以；一坐下就八圈，我受不了。",
      "output_sha256": "235076ec71d2932dd7d74cc0b6c38ea62af01605223f3094a053a4f63904b190",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "235076ec71d2932dd7d74cc0b6c38ea62af01605223f3094a053a4f63904b190",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "况且十几张牌，咱得把它们摆成五行，连这么办还有时把该留着的打出去。",
      "output_sha256": "4d713b46df9b7c5b7c6c235eb13e7ffcece4cbc632e489f7f2c41c35b8a18110",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "4d713b46df9b7c5b7c6c235eb13e7ffcece4cbc632e489f7f2c41c35b8a18110",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在我，这是消遣，慢慢的调动，考虑，点头，迟疑，原无不可；可是别人受得了吗。",
      "output_sha256": "a3ee1f73247ba0ae82e4034835f261485b6ebfa28a7dea9bd16c825db325af25",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "a3ee1f73247ba0ae82e4034835f261485b6ebfa28a7dea9bd16c825db325af25",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不如少一事，免得招人厌。",
      "output_sha256": "d9ca6dc826153bd898c949a7b37abb9d77ae88a2dea0e4b7d9259badae839388",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": 0.515158,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d0e9d39c6002faf0369e051e1d9b5c45d486dedc46612dd44e76a747c40b0d32"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d9ca6dc826153bd898c949a7b37abb9d77ae88a2dea0e4b7d9259badae839388",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "您说青岛这个地方，除了这些玩耍，还有什么可干的？",
      "output_sha256": "30294709b113b2691a8896b55ee08cc7e9354adb38b55330458e8bb6bddd574a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "30294709b113b2691a8896b55ee08cc7e9354adb38b55330458e8bb6bddd574a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "坦白说，我几乎与青岛没有关系，尽管我住在这里。",
      "output_sha256": "6909369625fe9d1996e2fd7dac9913d6c0b98125dfce3acf748c0f37c47fba8d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": 0.449882,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        65
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5645d0e947e5b8a67994094b5791bb4633fb0d4730eeb5c9f348ebbd28519fae"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6909369625fe9d1996e2fd7dac9913d6c0b98125dfce3acf748c0f37c47fba8d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        66
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有钱的人来青岛，好。",
      "output_sha256": "fb390d2af82eb1b855a5f59dc158906018140696bfbef068818526046b251ca9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_human_sha256": "fb390d2af82eb1b855a5f59dc158906018140696bfbef068818526046b251ca9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "上青岛来结婚，妙。",
      "output_sha256": "16a537a7a136337af0b0697ac50ba42939eaa0a337452416244b870ef7f61916",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_human_sha256": "16a537a7a136337af0b0697ac50ba42939eaa0a337452416244b870ef7f61916",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "爱玩的人来青岛，行。",
      "output_sha256": "bb9dcdd335949fae4d032b4ea6b49d85be0593f06cbf13f3e97cc8d86a14a0a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb9dcdd335949fae4d032b4ea6b49d85be0593f06cbf13f3e97cc8d86a14a0a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "对我而言，这里不过是一片美丽的沙漠。",
      "output_sha256": "db5546b1ce66ff1a25f07f3f64b94b7abfdc33794de653deabf516301701a92e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": 0.5375,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        69
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1b089ca3d9572005477c0fdfee9d08119daf83072e9f4242761d80662bfc313d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_ai_sha256": "db5546b1ce66ff1a25f07f3f64b94b7abfdc33794de653deabf516301701a92e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "对，有一件事我做还合适，而且很时行。",
      "output_sha256": "cbf009853410d6e32afef615584276e9562a7c566ee8d8f80317e267e5c8bbfb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 70,
      "source_human_sha256": "cbf009853410d6e32afef615584276e9562a7c566ee8d8f80317e267e5c8bbfb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 73,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "娶个姨太太。",
      "output_sha256": "87f424125a1b8c4c8d90ef119accdd7a46c2a20487c427844452313b0edc26f4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_human_sha256": "87f424125a1b8c4c8d90ef119accdd7a46c2a20487c427844452313b0edc26f4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 74,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是的，我得娶个姨太太。",
      "output_sha256": "b64b5cee467cd690063402a07d051c22003966baadcd20a49e5d6d44367b9484",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "b64b5cee467cd690063402a07d051c22003966baadcd20a49e5d6d44367b9484",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 75,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "又体面，又好玩。",
      "output_sha256": "23facac15691f1c833b315515a4bf8479ded1f426d7711520ba64bb9d021fd7e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_human_sha256": "23facac15691f1c833b315515a4bf8479ded1f426d7711520ba64bb9d021fd7e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 76,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "对，就这么办啦。",
      "output_sha256": "7c9b625053a08b3731bc68302b81ba1287d5615d1fcee792daab5d92709f6b71",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c9b625053a08b3731bc68302b81ba1287d5615d1fcee792daab5d92709f6b71",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 77,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我先别和太太商量，而暗中储蓄俩钱儿。",
      "output_sha256": "c61fa7d107a4a701f76c7331633df485f13a71a3ffefebbd329e72a1fdd27475",
      "alignment_unit_index": 71,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 75,
      "source_human_sha256": "c61fa7d107a4a701f76c7331633df485f13a71a3ffefebbd329e72a1fdd27475",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 78,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "等到娶了姨太太之后，也许我便唱得比鸭子好听，打牌也有了忍力……您等我的喜信吧！",
      "output_sha256": "52a1490e3a29341fd92214ca1b3fca0cd4319b37a0d7317831b3929ee50465cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 72,
      "alignment_score": null,
